    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020030,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "ええ\r\nどうしたの、電話なんて",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1048020020",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『ちょっと聞きたいことがあって──』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020040,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "何？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『…………差し入れって、何をもらったら嬉しい……？』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bgm": "101",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 300
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020050,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "はぁ……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『いや、すまん！　急にこんなこと……』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020060,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "……いいけど\r\nそれは──えぇと、一般的な話？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『あっ、違う違う！\r\nかなだったら、の話！』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020070,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『かなの舞台の稽古場にさ、贈ろうと思ったんだけど\r\n何がいいかピンと来なくて……』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『せっかくならかなに喜んでもらいたいし\r\n聞いた方が確実かな、と……思ったんだけど……』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020080,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020080",
    "autoWaitTime": 1600
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020090,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "……それで、私に聞くわけ？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『いやわかってる。わかってるよ……！\r\n野暮なのはわかってるから言わないでくれ……！』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020100,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "自分で言ってるじゃない",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020110,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "無難なものぐらい思いつくでしょうに\r\nスマートなんだか不器用なんだかわからない人",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『諸々かっこついてないのはスルーで頼む……！』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020120,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "スルーねぇ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020130,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "……でもまぁ、そうしてあげないこともないわ\r\nあなたのまっすぐさに免じて",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020140,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "こうやってツッコまれるかもしれないことより、確実に\r\n私が気に入る差し入れを用意する方を優先したんだものね？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『ああ！』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020150,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "……即答って",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020160,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "……っていうか、\r\nいいお返事してる場合じゃないでしょう",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020170,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "アイドルの好みなんて、\r\nあなたの立場なら把握してて然るべきじゃない？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020180,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "プロデューサーったら私のこと何も知らないのね？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『うっ……！\r\nか、返す言葉もない……！』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020190,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "ちょっ、嘘よ、嘘\r\n全部素直に受け止めないでったら",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『はは……\r\n自分でも反省していた内容だったから』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020200,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "真面目……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020200",
    "autoWaitTime": 1700
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020210,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "……そんなに真面目なら、\r\n勉強の機会でもあげましょうか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『？』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020220,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "あなたの都合がつくなら\r\n私の好きなもの、教えてあげるって言ってるの",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020230,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "……次の稽古のあと、\r\n買い物にでも行こうかと思ってたのよねー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『！』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『それ、一緒に行っても大丈夫ってことか……！？』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020240,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "……まぁ、プロデューサーに歩み寄るのも\r\nアイドルとしての仕事だし",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2802005020250,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "知った情報をいかして、\r\nあなたの仕事に還元してよね？　プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280200502/2802005020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『ははっ、おう！\r\nもちろんそれは任せてくれ！』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
